{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1529","id":4023920836,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87v2CjE","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1529","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1529.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1529.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1529","number":1529,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: add question-level MS source-view frontend closeout","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #1524.\n\nAdds the #1524 artifact builder for complete question-level post-attempt Mark Scheme source view frontend fixtures, scoped-alpha rehearsal, validator result, and final closeout. The builder consumes the merged #1521/#1522/#1523 checked-in artifacts and preserves the existing runtime route, self-assessment capture, signed/controlled delivery posture, feature-flag posture, and no-production-mutation boundary.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added `scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-frontend-fixtures.mjs` and package script.\n- Added focused Jest coverage for required fixture states, wording contract, fail-closed validation, launch verdicts, closeout counts, and zero side effects.\n- Generated the required #1524 artifacts:\n  - `post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-frontend-fixtures.v1.json`\n  - `post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-frontend-fixtures.manifest.v1.json`\n  - `post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-rehearsal.v1.json`\n  - `post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-final-closeout.v1.json`\n  - validator result and readback\n\n## Final counts\n\n- total runtime rows: 3530\n- total question groups: 3530\n- question-level source-view candidate rows/groups: 630/630\n- single-page eligible rows/groups: 598/598\n- multi-page eligible rows/groups: 32/32\n- complete-subpart coverage count: 630\n- partial/unknown coverage count: 2900\n- student-display eligible question-level views: 23\n- hidden/blocked rows: 3507\n- locator / visual QA / display policy / release scope blockers: 2900 / 13 / 594 / 0\n- same-page / multi-page exposure warning counts: 419 / 32\n- pre-attempt network request count: 0\n- initial payload/static props/bundle MS asset ref count: 0\n- reveal route call after action count: 1\n- banned wording count: 0\n- mobile readability: pass\n- side-effect total count: 0\n\nLaunch verdicts:\n\n```ts\nlaunch_readiness_verdict: {\n  scoped_alpha: \"ready_with_exceptions\",\n  full_9709_beta: \"blocked\",\n  public_launch: \"future_authorization_required\",\n}\n```\n\nThe closeout explicitly records that complete question-level candidate coverage expands to 630 groups, but current student-display eligible question-level views are 23, so it does not materially improve the previous 28-row eligible display baseline yet.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run method-map:build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-frontend-fixtures`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-assets.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-visual-qa.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-source-view-frontend-fixtures.test.js --verbose`\n- generated-artifact forbidden wording assertion: no matches in the #1524 generated artifacts\n- artifact validator readback: `validator_status=pass`, `check_fail_count=0`, `validation_error_count=0`, `side_effect_total_count=0`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run build -- --mode production`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (warning only for the expected dirty worktree before commit, branch naming is the AO-assigned `feat/issue-1524`)\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T17:43:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T17:56:13Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T17:56:13Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T17:56:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"c282d17e2df50c16d9ee03303ec20364611e5754","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1529/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1529/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1529/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/193c3925726852a4d5d84dbd7d522cabc712a5c1","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1524","ref":"feat/issue-1524","sha":"193c3925726852a4d5d84dbd7d522cabc712a5c1","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sa